            <description sparkle:format="plain-text"><![CDATA[All Playlists uses the standard Home, Live, Movies, and Series screens. Each playlist keeps its own category order, and the next playlist starts where the previous one ends.

Selecting a single playlist hides sections without content. A playlist with only live channels opens directly in Live.

The playlist menu supports individual selection, reloading playlists, and updating the TV guide.

This build supports Apple Silicon on macOS 14 or later. It uses Apple development signing and has not been notarized by Apple, so macOS may block its first launch.
]]></description>
